{"steamAppId":1275350,"description":"Ninja Kiwi Archive collects some of the best-loved Flash games from the Ninja Kiwi website in one amazing archival package. Enjoy your favorite Ninja Kiwi games and discover hidden gems from over 14 years of more awesomer, preserved in their original state even after browsers stop supporting Flash.\n\nAn awesome collection of 60+ classic web games, stored in a time capsule.\n\nExperience the forerunners to iconic games like Bloons TD 6.\n\nPlay the Flash version of popular Steam games like Bloons TD 5, Bloons Monkey City, Bloons TD Battles and SAS: Zombie Assault 4.\n\nLog in to your Ninja Kiwi account and reclaim your progress and save games from the web.\n\nEnjoy the best single and multiplayer Flash game experiences!","short_description":"Enjoy some of the best loved Flash games of the past in this awesome time capsule of over 60 Ninja Kiwi classics. Experience a piece of history and play the original Flash games that spawned the worldwide phenomenon of Bloons TD.","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1275350/header.jpg?t=1770224080","developer":"Ninja Kiwi","publisher":"Ninja Kiwi","genre":"Экшены, Казуальные игры, Стратегии","platforms":["Windows"],"modes":["Один игрок","Многопользовательская","PvP по сети","Кооператив","Кооператив на одном экране"],"playerCount":131,"releaseLabel":"8 июл. 2020 г.","comingSoon":false,"metacritic":null,"metacriticUrl":null,"steam":93,"steamReviewCount":5826,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1275350/ss_a13d815e6fe4018841e3958ef7e29f1be4d3a91a.600x338.jpg?t=1770224080","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1275350/ss_a13d815e6fe4018841e3958ef7e29f1be4d3a91a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770224080"},{"id":1,"image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1275350/ss_05d53163978590cdb5127b733aa865476d06e32b.600x338.jpg?t=1770224080","full":